{"5029120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tell, Draw, Guess", "steam_appid": 5029120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hilarious Online Drawing Party Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tell, Draw, Guess</strong> is an online multiplayer party game where you draw, describe, and deduce with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess drawings, recreate pictures from hilarious descriptions, or survive as the only player who doesn't know the secret word in <strong>Drawing Mafia</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're an amazing artist or can barely draw a stick figure, it doesn't matter.<br>Sometimes the worst drawings create the biggest laughs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drawing Mafia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player doesn't know the secret word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone else draws the same word, while the Mafia must blend in by interpreting everyone else's drawings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all drawings are finished, it's time to vote.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's not the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mafia gets one final chance to guess the secret word and steal the victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you fool your friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras/ac2c52c33e7ce45bf1e742521a2182fb.avif?t=1785890536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras_big/ac2c52c33e7ce45bf1e742521a2182fb.avif?t=1785890536 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras/52c6da0d0cd801e2a69ad2ff410c3798.avif?t=1785890536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras_big/52c6da0d0cd801e2a69ad2ff410c3798.avif?t=1785890536 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Describe &amp; Draw</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player sees the picture and describes it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone else must recreate it using only the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It sounds easy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the final drawing looks nothing like the original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How well can you communicate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras/6063d7aac7acb8744539ce3e0f149334.avif?t=1785890536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras_big/6063d7aac7acb8744539ce3e0f149334.webp?t=1785890536 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras/d6a5e09d204295880d3bc1acbc75e841.avif?t=1785890536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras_big/d6a5e09d204295880d3bc1acbc75e841.webp?t=1785890536 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Worse You Draw, The More Fun It Gets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a game about artistic skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crooked lines, strange doodles, and completely ridiculous masterpieces are all part of the fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump online with your friends, chat over voice, bluff, laugh, and enjoy the ultimate drawing party.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hilarious Online Drawing Party Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tell, Draw, Guess</strong> is an online multiplayer party game where you draw, describe, and deduce with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess drawings, recreate pictures from hilarious descriptions, or survive as the only player who doesn't know the secret word in <strong>Drawing Mafia</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're an amazing artist or can barely draw a stick figure, it doesn't matter.<br>Sometimes the worst drawings create the biggest laughs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drawing Mafia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player doesn't know the secret word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone else draws the same word, while the Mafia must blend in by interpreting everyone else's drawings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all drawings are finished, it's time to vote.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that's not the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mafia gets one final chance to guess the secret word and steal the victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you fool your friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras/ac2c52c33e7ce45bf1e742521a2182fb.avif?t=1785890536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras_big/ac2c52c33e7ce45bf1e742521a2182fb.avif?t=1785890536 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras/52c6da0d0cd801e2a69ad2ff410c3798.avif?t=1785890536\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029120/extras_big/52c6da0d0cd801e2a69ad2ff410c3798.avif?t=1785890536 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Describe &amp; Draw</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player sees the picture and describes it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone else must recreate it using only the description.</